      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, \"Closet\"? I don't think that's a category in QuickBooks lol. Also, are you saying I can deduct the whole thing this year or do I have to spread it out over a few years? I'm worried about how much I'm actually getting back if I claim it all now vs later.",
